4
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:07,160
and I use the acronym RAISE to remember it.

5
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:09,520
So R stands for remind them of the value they've gotten.

6
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:12,040
A is address the price trades directly.

7
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:14,240
So don't try and like hide it somewhere like be upfront.

8
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:15,680
I is invest in their future.

9
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,520
Basically frame the price increase

10
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:18,880
in the context of the value

11
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,960
that you're gonna keep investing in to help them out.

12
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,520
S is soften the news with a loyalty discount

13
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,120
that expires in three to six months from now.

14
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,960
And then E, explain away their concerns

15
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,800
with a PS statement at the bottom of the letter.

16
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:29,840
And so this is what it looks like

17
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:30,680
